[[2047,15,8,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The integrated services control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nmanages the operation of the central locking.</p><p>The direct supply for the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n8 of connector B) arrives directly from the battery via the line\nprotect by maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from\n2/99)  and fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F8</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .; pin 13\nof connector B provides the reference earth.</p><p>The receiver of the remote control \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\na supply controlled by the ignition  (INT) from the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and directly from the battery via the\nline of the maxifuse\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from\n2/99) and fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The control unit M40 receives the following inputs:</p><ul><li>commands coming from the front locks <strong>N50</strong> and <strong>N51</strong> for\nlocking (pin 15 of connector B) or for unlocking (pin 16 of connector\nB) the doors;</li><li>signals on the state of the door locks coming from the\nfour geared motors <strong>N50</strong> , <strong>N51</strong> , <strong>N55</strong> and <strong>N56</strong> ,\nrespectively at pins 3 and 2 of connector B and 3 and 7 of connector\nC. (<a href=\"#/3233915\">E2510</a>).</li><li>(only with remote control) the signals from the remote\ncontrol <strong>M35</strong> receiver for locking (pin 6 of connector C) or\nfor unlocking (pin 15 of connector C);</li></ul><p>In accordance with the logic described above,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                                controls the locks: the signals for\nthe motors of the front doors (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N51</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) and rear doors\n(\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               ed N\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>56</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) come from pins 4 and 5 of connector B.</p>"]]